<view class="page">
  <view class="card head">
    <image class="logo" src="/images/logo.png" mode="aspectFit" />
    <view>
      <view class="brand">四季果先</view>
      <view class="muted">SEASONAL FRUIT · 现切现做 · 新鲜一小时</view>
      <view class="muted" style="margin-top:8rpx">{{user.nickName || '果粉'}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card menu">
    <view class="row" bindtap="goCoupons">
      <text>我的优惠券</text>
      <text class="badge" wx:if="{{couponUnused}}">{{couponUnused}} 张可用</text>
    </view>
    <view class="row" bindtap="goGroupBuy">企业团购</view>
    <view class="row" bindtap="goOrders">我的订单</view>
    <view class="row" bindtap="reLogin">重新登录</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card tip">
    <view class="title">取餐说明</view>
    <view class="muted">支付成功后会生成取餐码。我们按取餐时间现切，保证取餐前最多 1 小时制作完成；到店出示取餐码即可。</view>
  </view>
</view>
